Revision history for Mem20 (Perl SDK)

0.3.0  2026-11-16
    - Surface bump to the live 4.0.0 surface: 487 tools across 129 domains
      (was 311/39). The counts are no longer literals in Mem20::Version; they
      are re-exported from the generated Mem20::Surface manifest.
    - New lib/Mem20/Surface.pm, generated by xt/gen-surface.pl from
      docs/surface.json and web/src/data/tools.json. It carries the full
      487-name list and the tool-to-domain map, so verify_surface now names
      the exact tools that moved (missing/extra) instead of only reporting
      that a count changed.
    - New client accessors: tool_domain, tools_in_domain, domains.
    - t/05-surface.t now also asserts the manifest is internally consistent
      and not stale against the repository surface files, and treats 311 as
      a retired count.
    - SERVER_VERSION 4.0.0 -> 4.0.0.

0.2.0  2026-11-01
    - Publishable CPAN distribution: added MANIFEST, MANIFEST.SKIP,
      LICENSE and this Changes file. `make dist` previously failed with
      "Problem opening MANIFEST: No such file or directory".
    - Verified against mem20 server 4.0.0: 311 tools across 39 domain
      modules (311 unique names).
    - t/05-surface.t guards the documented 311/39 surface against drift
      and resolves the dist root from __FILE__ so it works under CI.
    - Core-Perl only: no non-core runtime prerequisites (enforced by
      t/00-load.t against Module::CoreList).

0.1.0  2026-10-14
    - First cut: JSON-RPC 2.0 over stdio, MCP handshake, tools/list,
      tools/call, dynamic dispatch, job polling.
